description=Installs microG GmsCore as a privileged system app with a privapp-permissions whitelist, so it can register as Android's network location provider. Requires a working microG install. Build locally with scripts/build-module.sh. See github.com/elizabethwilderose-dot/MicroG-Life360-Magisk
